[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

; One variable: the editor kite of a Bone2D chain (skeleton_2d.cpp:189-354). It draws only with the
; Gizmos toggle on, which the goldens bone2d-unselected and bone2d-selected set, so no other scene
; shows a regression in it. The chain holds a bone turned and scaled by its parent, a child bone that
; sets its own gizmo off, a leaf that draws along its authored length and angle, and a leaf that
; calculates its angle from its own rotation, and a bone that carries the IK pose override meta above a
; child that is the root of an instanced scene. The scale of 1.5 shows the kite width staying 5 pixels.

